1
00:00:13,547 --> 00:00:20,618
The dusty tires halt and slide,
The car door opens to the heat.

2
00:00:20,803 --> 00:00:28,570
No walls or distance left to hide,
As two running bodies meet.

3
00:00:30,758 --> 00:00:38,207
The gravel flies beneath our feet,
We sprint across the blinding light.

4
00:00:38,292 --> 00:00:45,850
The bitter weeks of our defeat,
Are blown away into the night.

5
00:00:46,841 --> 00:00:53,665
And we crash and hold so tight,
With a salty, crying kiss.

6
00:00:53,964 --> 00:01:01,357
We escape the cage of night,
And we drown in breathing bliss.

7
00:01:01,437 --> 00:01:08,259
Let the heavy dam now break,
Let the tears run wild and free.

8
00:01:08,484 --> 00:01:20,910
Every breath we had to do,
Brought us back to you and me.

9
00:01:22,612 --> 00:01:30,016
The empty rooms and boiling tents,
The silent choir and lonely bed.

10
00:01:30,099 --> 00:01:37,932
We survived the cold defense,
And all the sissing voices said.

11
00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:44,506
We hold each other by the neck,
And we tremble in the dust.

12
00:01:44,968 --> 00:01:56,447
Building up our lives from wreck,
In this wild and desperate trust.

13
00:02:23,366 --> 00:02:30,654
And we crash and hold so tight,
With a salty, crying kiss.

14
00:02:30,697 --> 00:02:37,749
We escape the cage of night,
And we drown in breathing bliss.

15
00:02:37,818 --> 00:02:44,472
Let the heavy dam now break,
Let the tears run wild and free.

16
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:58,035
Every breath we had to do,
Brought us back to you and me.

17
00:02:58,942 --> 00:03:06,050
We feel the fire of the skin,
The breathing deep inside the chest.

18
00:03:06,252 --> 00:03:14,637
The golden storm we are within,
Where our weary souls can rest.

19
00:03:19,694 --> 00:03:26,463
No more silence in the dark,
No more walls of heavy stone.

20
00:03:26,713 --> 00:03:34,073
We are the fire and the spark,
And we are no more alone.

21
00:03:34,083 --> 00:03:40,902
We will never let each other go,
We will never walk away.

22
00:03:41,251 --> 00:03:51,180
Let the roaring waters flow,
We are here to stay.

23
00:04:03,218 --> 00:04:10,339
No more cages, no more bars,
Only wild and endless space.

24
00:04:10,393 --> 00:04:23,740
Underneath the summer stars,
In this holy, warm embrace.

